{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t新皇崗口岸開通一個月，深圳邊檢總站表示，首月共錄得出入境人員334萬人次，日均逾11萬人次，較口岸升級前升逾一倍。<br/>\n<br/>\n深港雙方近期已在多個口岸設立亞太經合組織峰會的專用櫃枱。運輸及物流局局長陳美寶表示，會提供清晰訊息及指示，讓旅客高效過關直接抵達會議會場。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:03:51.884260+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T11:37:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T20:57:49.920413+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T11:57:24.495499+00:00","content_hash":"8da26ad22dfe3221406aa1b1c78b3b526f62f9f2d2e374fed253c126d1121906","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}